{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_01B330","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"C4炸药已经开发完成。在ENTRY GATE装备后，就能带进任务。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"那可帮大忙了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"要放置C4，首先得先装备它。从武器选择菜单里选择C4。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"装备后，按住<I=AIM>再按<I=ATK>。这样就能放置C4。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=AIM> <I=ATK>","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"怎么引爆？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不要按<I=AIM>，直接按<I=ATK>。听好了，是不要按<I=AIM>。当然，C4必须保持装备状态。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=AIM> <I=ATK> <I=AIM>","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"如果按着<I=AIM>，就会在原地再放置一个C4。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=AIM>","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我会注意。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"换句话说，C4可以放置多个。而且会按放置顺序依次引爆，好好利用这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"}]}